The pinned build source, including its GPL-3.0 LICENSE, is committed in vendor/.
Docker builds use that local copy and apply scripts/patch-limiter.py; they do
not fetch Limiter source or its container image from GitHub. The adapter keeps
the upstream action handler, monitor, grouping rules, restore queue, settings
manager, and Telegram bot. Unused upstream deployment files and the GitHub
update checker are omitted from the vendored copy.
